          "title": "You'll want to know: ધાવવું",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ધાવવું — dhāvvũ — \"to suckle; to feed at the breast\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "બાળક માતાને ધાવે છે. bāḷak mātāne dhāve che. The baby is feeding at its mother's breast."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past (it …): તે બાળક ધાવ્યું, te bāḷak dhāvyũ."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ધાવવું (dhāvvũ) is inherited from Sanskrit dhāpayatē, \"suckles\"; CDIAL lists the Gujarati verb, \"to suck at the breast\" (CDIAL 6784)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
