          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "હીંચોળવું (hī̃coḷvũ) is built on the stem that CDIAL lists as Gujarati hĩcvũ, \"to swing\", under a reconstructed hicc- (CDIAL 14083); હિંચકો (hincko), \"a swing\", is its cousin."
            }
